<h3 class="wiki-sub-heading eng-heading">(3. Greek mythological God)</h3>
<h3 class="wiki-sub-heading">ক্র</h3>
<h3 class="wiki-sub-heading">বিষয়ক দেবতা</h3>
<h3 class="wiki-sub-heading">গ্রিক</h3>
<h3 class="wiki-sub-heading">মূলক</h3>
